<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thirteen stocks fell, two rose and three were flat in 13.1-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday, with the WIG index closing one percent lower that in regular session at 1,842 points.</p>
<p>The remaining stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 0.9 percent in a 28.2-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
